B.LS=s(["We will make reasonable efforts to process valid withdrawal requests within the timeframe communicated by the application.","A withdrawal request may initially appear as pending while it is being processed.","A pending withdrawal does not necessarily mean that the transfer has reached the User's bank account.","The actual time required for funds to reach a bank account may depend on:","- our processing systems;","- payment providers;","- banking institutions;","- bank operating hours;","- technical interruptions;","- compliance reviews; and","- other circumstances outside our reasonable control.","Where a transfer fails, is reversed, or cannot be completed, we may return the affected amount to the User's wallet after verification."],t.s)
B.a0I=new A.by("21. WITHDRAWAL PROCESSING",B.LS,null)
B.Kp=s(["Unless we expressly authorize otherwise, each individual may maintain only one YOUSABIBALL account.","You must not:","- create multiple accounts;","- operate accounts on behalf of other persons;","- allow another person to use your account;","- create another account to avoid a restriction;","- create additional accounts to obtain promotional benefits; or","- use multiple identities to participate in the Services.","Where we reasonably determine that multiple accounts are associated with the same person or are being used to circumvent our rules, we may suspend or terminate the relevant accounts and investigate related transactions.","Any action taken under this section will be subject to applicable law and the circumstances of the case."],t.s)
B.a0J=new A.by("5. ONE ACCOUNT PER USER",B.Kp,null)
B.M9=s(["The Services may use systems designed to select questions from available football question pools.","Where our systems are designed to prevent repetition of questions that a User has previously answered correctly, such systems will operate according to the question-selection logic available at the time.","However, we do not guarantee that a User will never encounter a previously displayed question, particularly where:","- the available question pool is limited;","- questions have been updated;","- categories have changed;","- technical circumstances affect question selection; or","- the platform introduces new question-selection mechanisms."],t.s)
B.a0K=new A.by("10. QUESTION SELECTION AND REPEAT QUESTIONS",B.M9,null)
B.M_=s(["The balance displayed in the application may be affected by:","- pending transactions;","- payment confirmation;","- contest processing;","- rewards processing;","- refunds;","- withdrawals;","- technical synchronization; or","- other transaction events.","Where there is a discrepancy between the displayed balance and our verified transaction records, we may investigate and reconcile the account.","Our transaction records will be maintained as evidence of account activity, subject to applicable law and correction of demonstrable errors."],t.s)
B.a0L=new A.by("14. WALLET BALANCE ACCURACY",B.M_,null)
B.MB=s(["A contest may present football-related questions sequentially.","Each question may provide multiple answer options.","You must select the answer you believe to be correct within the time permitted by the application.","Unless the applicable contest rules state otherwise, the platform may provide approximately 23 seconds for each question.","The timer is controlled by the Services and is not controlled by the User.","When the permitted time expires:","- an unanswered question may be recorded as unanswered;","- the User may receive no credit for that question; and","- the contest may proceed according to the applicable contest rules.","Users are responsible for maintaining a suitable internet connection and ensuring that their device is functioning properly during participation."],t.s)
B.a0M=new A.by("8. HOW QUESTIONS WORK",B.MB,null)
B.Ni=s(["The application may distinguish between:","- your total wallet balance; and","- the amount currently eligible for withdrawal.","Your withdrawable balance may depend on:","- completed contest entries;","- qualifying rewards;","- the status of deposited funds;","- refunds or reversals;","- pending transactions;","- account verification;","- transaction reviews; and","- other applicable account conditions.","The amount displayed as your available wallet balance is therefore not necessarily the same as the amount available for withdrawal."],t.s)
B.a0N=new A.by("18. WITHDRAWABLE BALANCE",B.Ni,null)
B.MV=s(["YOUSABIBALL may reference football clubs, leagues, competitions, players, managers, historical events, statistics, photographs, or other football-related information belonging to third parties.","Third-party names, trademarks, logos, statistics, and other intellectual property remain the property of their respective owners.","Unless expressly stated otherwise, DAMTEE TECH HUB does not claim ownership of third-party intellectual property merely because it is referenced within the Services.","Nothing in these Terms should be interpreted as creating an affiliation, endorsement, sponsorship, or partnership with a football club, league, competition organizer, player, or other rights holder unless expressly stated."],t.s)
B.a0O=new A.by("30. THIRD-PARTY FOOTBALL RIGHTS",B.MV,null)
B.Lq=s(["Certain contests require an entry amount.","The minimum entry amount for eligible contests is currently \u20a650 (Fifty Nigerian Naira) unless a different amount is expressly displayed for a particular contest.","The applicable entry amount will be displayed before you confirm participation.","Once an entry is successfully confirmed:","1. the entry amount may be deducted from your available wallet balance;","2. the entry becomes associated with your account;","3. the applicable contest rules become binding on that entry; and","4. the entry cannot ordinarily be cancelled once the contest has commenced.","We may change minimum or specific entry amounts in the future. Any applicable amount will be displayed before you confirm participation."],t.s)
B.a0P=new A.by("7. ENTRY AMOUNTS",B.Lq,null)
B.MI=s(["Your privacy is important to us.","Our collection, use, storage, disclosure, and protection of personal information are governed by our separate Privacy Notice.","The Privacy Notice explains, among other things:","- information we collect;","- why we collect it;","- how we use it;","- circumstances in which we share it;","- how we protect it;","- retention practices; and","- applicable data-subject rights.","The Privacy Notice forms part of these Terms by reference.","We will process personal information in accordance with applicable data-protection requirements."],t.s)
B.a0Q=new A.by("36. PRIVACY AND PERSONAL DATA",B.MI,null)
B.Lz=s(["Certain features may allow Users to submit information, comments, feedback, suggestions, or other material.","You remain responsible for anything you submit.","You must not submit material that:","- infringes another person's rights;","- contains unlawful content;","- is fraudulent or misleading;","- contains malicious software;","- is abusive or threatening; or","- violates these Terms.","We may remove content that violates these Terms or applicable law."],t.s)
B.a0R=new A.by("34. USER CONTENT",B.Lz,null)
B.MU=s(["Certain Services require you to create an account.","When creating an account, you may be required to provide information including your:","- name;","- email address;","- telephone number;","- password; and","- other information reasonably required for account operation or verification.","You agree that all information supplied to us must be accurate and kept up to date.","You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials.","You must immediately notify us if you believe:","- someone has obtained your password;","- your account has been accessed without permission;","- your account information has been compromised; or","- an unauthorized transaction has occurred.","We may take reasonable steps to secure your account, including temporarily restricting access while an investigation is conducted."],t.s)
B.a0S=new A.by("4. USER ACCOUNT",B.MU,null)
