B.LV=s(["By creating an YOUSABIBALL account or continuing to use the Services, you acknowledge that:","- you have read these Terms;","- you understand these Terms;","- you agree to comply with these Terms;","- you understand the rules applicable to each contest before participating;","- you are responsible for maintaining the security of your account;","- you understand that entry amounts are deducted from your available wallet balance when an entry is successfully submitted;","- you understand that rewards are subject to the applicable contest rules and account verification requirements;","- you understand that deposited funds are subject to the applicable fund-usage requirements before becoming eligible for withdrawal; and","- you agree to comply with all applicable laws and regulations.","DAMTEE TECH HUB","YOUSABIBALL","Last Updated: September 14, 2026"],t.s)
B.a15=new A.by("55. USER ACKNOWLEDGEMENT",B.LV,null)
B.JZ=s(["YOUSABIBALL may provide Users with an electronic wallet associated with their account.","The wallet may be used to:","- receive eligible rewards;","- hold funds added through supported payment methods;","- pay applicable entry amounts; and","- receive eligible refunds or adjustments.","Your wallet balance is an electronic record of the amounts recognized by our systems as available to your account.","Wallet balances may be subject to reconciliation.","If an amount is incorrectly credited to your wallet because of a technical, processing, accounting, or other error, we may correct the balance.","If you become aware that your account has been incorrectly credited, you must notify us and must not knowingly use or withdraw the incorrectly credited amount."],t.s)
B.a16=new A.by("13. WALLET",B.JZ,null)
B.Lm=s(["For purposes of maintaining a clear distinction between deposited funds and rewards, amounts added to your wallet may be subject to the platform's fund-usage requirement before becoming eligible for withdrawal.","Unless otherwise expressly stated in the applicable promotion or account rules:","A deposited amount must be fully used for eligible contest entries before that deposited amount may form part of the User's withdrawable balance.","This means that adding money to your wallet does not automatically make the same deposited amount immediately available for withdrawal.","For example, if you add \u20a610,000 to your wallet, that amount is intended for participation in eligible contests. The applicable portion of the deposited amount becomes eligible for withdrawal only after satisfying the platform's applicable usage requirement.","This requirement does not prevent eligible rewards from being credited to your account in accordance with the applicable contest rules.","We maintain transaction records to determine the status of deposited funds and amounts eligible for withdrawal."],t.s)
B.a17=new A.by("17. DEPOSIT USAGE AND WITHDRAWABLE FUNDS",B.Lm,null)
